{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>台灣九合一選舉今日（28日）上午8時至下午4時投票，隨即開票。台媒「聯合新聞網」引述台北市民政局統計，截至下午3時30分，台北市12行政區平均投票率達68.85%，已超越上屆（2022 年）的67.7%。 （聯合新聞網）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:56:17.868010+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T08:22:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T08:49:55.047345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:49:55.047345+00:00","content_hash":"67bf9b2c1a238567331e6c426b34734be8aac64976a5641c3f9375be346ea736","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}